WEBVTT

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.580
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.110
In this wide world

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:28.290
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:34.860
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:38.490
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:45.610
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.580
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:55.890
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.650
Awaken now

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:11.930
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:19.210
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.980
It's certain

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:26.350
Woh woh

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:35.060
It's been three days since Belldandy
returned to Heaven

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.030
to have her license renewed.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:39.090
I'm home, everyone!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.790
Welcome home, Big Sister!

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:45.070
Here, Keiichi.

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:46.440
Thanks.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:48.460
So what about your goddess license?

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:51.540
I had it reissued without any trouble!

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.250
It makes me nervous with you all
looking at me like this.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.150
C'mon, Big Sister, hurry!

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:01.950
And make it snazzy!

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.590
All right then...

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:11.090
Oh, Water Spirits, Windinae, grant the
flowers of our garden moisture.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:25.110
Ah! Would It Be Okay If I Were A Demon?!

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.080
How terrible!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.080
Why'd it blow up?

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:33.280
It has been a while, so maybe you
made a mistake with the spell?

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:34.980
That couldn't be...

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:38.890
Belldandy, show me that
new license once more.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.290
Demon?!

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:46.690
But how? I took the training course,
just like I was supposed to!

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.870
So, as you can see it is quite
dangerous to use magic

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:52.200
without the utmost attention to your spell.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:55.940
When casting an attack spell,
look to your right, then left,

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.870
then once more to your right
before proceeding.

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.380
Also at that time, practice good manners

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:05.150
by loudly announcing the name and
type of the spell you are about to cast.

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:06.510
Eh, the next thing...

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:09.510
Thank you very much.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:12.850
I'll be returning to Keiichi's home now.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:16.560
Sure. Just try not to cause any more
accidents or anything.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.260
I will!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:17.660
Stop it right there!
I will!

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:18.590
Stop it right there!

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.320
Rewinding memory projector!

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.560
Found it... Zoom in!

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:27.470
Ah! Marller!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.900
It figures.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:33.480
Has the mark on your forehead changed
because of the different license?

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:37.280
I never noticed because nothing like this
has ever happened to me before.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.680
Do you feel bad otherwise?

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.680
Nothing really seems different.

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:44.750
Ah, okay.

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:46.420
What do you mean "okay"?!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:49.160
Big Sister's been turned into a DEMON!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.560
But since it's the issuing office's mistake,

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.100
can't she just file for a new one
and go right back to normal?

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.690
I am going to file a notice right away!

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.070
It's protected from demons gaining access.

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:04.210
Then how did Marller get into Heaven?

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:07.440
I'm sure that SHE'S somehow behind this.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:08.840
"She"?

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:11.150
With Hild's power,
Marller could have done it...

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:16.690
Listen, if you keep on behaving
good like a goddess,

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.750
certain disaster will befall us.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.890
Then what should she do?

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:23.430
She'll have to commit some evil deeds.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:26.900
Like not separate the trash,
make little kids cry and stuff.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:30.100
Belldandy would never be able
to do something like that!

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:33.430
I'm just kidding. Of course I know that!

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.910
Why does it take so much time?!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.410
What'd they say?

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:41.080
It'll take a month to fix things.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.510
That long?

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.380
The central office is always like that.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.750
When I had my license suspended,
it took them forever to process things.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.450
They also said that I couldn't do it.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.720
Do what?

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:55.780
Her representative has to be
at least 18 years old.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.760
So you come with me, Urd.

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:01.100
This is why I hate dealing
with the central office!

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.860
Can't you just contact the Almighty directly?

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:07.200
We'd be waiting in line for years and years.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.010
This happened because I was careless.

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.210
So it really is best if I go myself.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:15.080
But you wouldn't even be able
to get through the gates.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.740
It's gonna be okay, Big Sister.
Leave it to us!

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.180
Her symptoms are getting worse.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.650
Just leave it to us and stay out of trouble.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:27.680
I swear I'll do something about this!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.630
Take care of things for Belldandy,

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.400
and see to it that she won't need
to use any kind of magic.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.400
R-Right...

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:37.170
You're gonna pay for it if anything
happens to Big Sister!

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.390
R-Right!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.300
Heavenly Manju

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.930
Heavenly Manju
I'm sorry about this.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:46.710
I was so focused on being a goddess that
I didn't look over it like I should have.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.540
I was careless.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:52.410
Hey, I think it's more than a coincidence
that Marller was there.

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:57.150
If I can keep things so that you
don't need to use any magic,

00:05:57.150 --> 00:06:00.120
Urd and Skuld will take care of the
proceedings, and you'll be set.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.480
It'll be all right!

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:03.690
Okay.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.900
My training is over!

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.770
It's the priest?!

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:14.740
Oh! Welcome home!

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:18.710
Lady Belldandy! It has been quite a while!

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:22.780
I have returned, hoping to gain your
approval of my Buddhist power,

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:26.220
which I have honed through ascetic training...

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:27.050
Huh?

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:29.480
Fiend! Who are you?!

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:32.520
Oh! Such waves of evil energy!

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:35.320
How dare you attempt to
deceive me, foul spirit?!

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:38.920
What have you done with the real Belldandy?!

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:41.430
Abiraunken, sowaka!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.860
Keiichi!

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:51.370
It may be that the demonic force
is fully active in me.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:56.070
Have I really turned into a demon?

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.680
If I can't turn back into a goddess,

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:04.280
I may not be able to be with you any longer!

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:08.150
It's only until Urd gets this
matter taken care of.

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:12.620
All you need to do right now
is just rely on me.

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:14.700
You're right...

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.840
I'm sorry! This must be my fault, too.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.640
Changing a tire isn't any big deal!

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:29.810
It's under control, don't let it get to you.

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:32.380
Okay...

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:34.750
Nekomi House I

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:37.750
Oh, Morisato!

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:40.490
Sorry, but now's not a good time.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:41.850
I see.

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:43.930
Sorry, man.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:45.290
I see...

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.090
I'm sorry, Kei-chan!

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:52.230
No good here either, huh...

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.530
It's the demonic force.

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:59.140
Looks like it's started.

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:04.710
You accepted the license, but if you
don't pledge to live as a demon,

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.420
you'll experience nothing
but eternal misfortune!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.650
Yes, indeed.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:09.810
Lady Hild!

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.720
I'm surprised you could hatch
a scheme like this.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.260
Well, of course I can!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:19.460
And in any case, I have done it all
to please you, Lady Hild!

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:20.500
I'm ignoring profit entirely,
I'm prepared to go into the red!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.270
I'm ignoring profit entirely,
I'm prepared to go into the red!
Belldandy... How much fun will you show us?

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.230
I'll bust my butt and give all I've got to
