We'll figure the rest out tomorrow.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:39.350
Even now, you're not flustered, are you?

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:43.620
This is nothing compared to some of
what we've been through before.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.920
Plus, no matter where I am,
as long as I'm with you...

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:51.390
Er, and if anything happens to you, I can't
imagine what Urd and Skuld will do to me!

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:52.830
Keiichi...

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.160
Belldandy...

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:56.400
Morisato!

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.500
S-Senior!

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.370
I come back to the clubhouse to get
something I forgot, and what do I see?!

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:01.870
This is a complete outrage!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.570
You have broken the Iron Law of
the Nekomi Tech Auto Club

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:07.910
by having a lovers' rendezvous in the
clubhouse, you insolent wretch!

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.140
You're outta the club!

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:10.270
Huh?!

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:15.750
I'm so sorry!

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.910
H-Hey, it's all right!

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:23.560
Wait a minute! How the heck long
do you plan to keep us waiting?!

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:26.630
I'm telling you that a Goddess First Class,
Second Category, Unlimited License

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:28.500
is facing a dire emergency!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.770
That's a mouthful.

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:31.770
What'll you do if something happens to her

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:34.270
while we're standing around here
wasting time now?!

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:36.610
The Goddess Assistance Agency will be
shocked to hear about this!

