00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:45.150
What's wrong?

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:46.810
My wallet's gone.

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:53.460
Keiichi, maybe I could do
something with my magic...

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:57.590
No way. They told us you can't use it, right?

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.700
I guess you're right.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.630
But at this rate, you'll...

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:03.790
Huh?

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.500
It's that manju I had earlier.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.400
Looks like Heaven hasn't
forsaken us after all, eh?

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:13.640
Um... it's past the expiration date.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:18.270
I'm sorry! The souvenirs I brought you are...

00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:30.190
How could the engine have
gone bad today of all days?

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:32.820
Belldandy?

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:36.690
Run on ahead and take cover from
the rain under the bridge.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.600
I'll help you out!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.200
This is the motorcycle you love...

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:41.640
Belldandy!
This is the motorcycle you love...

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:42.500
Belldandy!

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:45.810
I can't let you stay here like this.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:49.470
Besides, it's about time I performed
some maintenance on this anyway.

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:57.010
This motorcycle is a precious friend
that's been with us for so long.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.550
We can't just leave it behind!

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:05.320
No! You mustn't use magic now!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.460
Please...

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:09.160
Stop it!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.810
No!

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:25.510
I'm sorry... I'm sorry!

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:28.910
Don't cry, Belldandy.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.810
But... But this is all my fault...

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:35.090
It's not your fault at all.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:38.720
You just can't use your powers
that well right now.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:41.430
But they'll be back before you know it.

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:43.530
The rain's stopped.

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:45.560
Let's just get out of here for now.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:46.990
Okay.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.170
Keiichi!

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.140
Keiichi!

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:54.910
He's got an extremely high fever!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:56.400
Why?

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:58.940
Why did this happen?

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:17.730
And I'm supposed to be from the
Goddess Assistance Agency.

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:26.040
Not only am I no use to Keiichi,
but I'm actually a burden.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.200
You're in quite the pickle, eh, Belldandy?

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.050
Marller!

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:33.740
Why have you done such an awful thing?

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:37.280
Because I'm a demon, obviously!

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:41.390
Keiichi has nothing to do with our quarrel!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:47.190
Don't be silly! You've caused this
by trying to do good deeds.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:51.200
I only wanted to help Keiichi!

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:56.030
You can fix this by sucking it up and
helping us to expand our share.

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:59.240
You want me to help you demons?

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:01.140
Yeah, you got it.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:06.210
You'll be able to give Keiichi happiness
if you live by the path of evil, as a demon.

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.840
Ah, the demonic way of life
is truly wonderful!

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:11.810
Keiichi...

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:18.150
If you commit evil deeds, it will all come back
to Keiichi in the form of happiness.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:21.120
Not such a bad deal, is it?

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:27.700
All right.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:31.000
From now on, I will align myself
with the path of evil.

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:32.870
Good.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:38.080
If I commit evil deeds,
it will help Keiichi...

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:41.410
Something bad... Something bad...

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:44.320
Something extremely bad...

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:52.090
Keiichi's fever is going down!

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:54.080
She must be on the path of evil already!

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:03.130
A goddess ignoring traffic signals...

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:04.770
BOOKS
open

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.780
A goddess standing and reading
without buying...

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.280
A GODDESS WUZ HERE!

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.670
A goddess drawing graffiti...

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:16.810
Ooh, dreadful! Simply dreadful!

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:21.420
There you go, just take it easy
and go on across.

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:25.690
Oh, no! What am I doing?!

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:29.960
His fever's gone back up.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:37.260
A... A goddess getting blind stinking drunk...

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:47.450
Huh? Belldandy?

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:49.320
Awake, are you?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.520
Marller?!

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:55.260
Be glad. She has decided to ally
herself with the forces of evil.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.250
Huh?

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.960
Hey, that's right!

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:01.660
You're the one behind all this
in the first place!

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:05.070
You give Belldandy's license back!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:08.470
It's long gone!
I put it through the shredder!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.070
What a lousy thing to do!

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:14.540
It's been causing Belldandy a lot of pain!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:16.280
Gee, that's a surprise.

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:19.150
Because I've arranged it so that
the more evil deeds she commits,

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:21.450
the happier the two of you will be.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.750
What do you think? I'll bet you're delighted.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:27.420
There's no way we'd be able to
find happiness that way!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:32.590
But the reason you're so full of energy now
is because of her misdeeds!

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:35.150
Belldandy's?

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:41.230
She changed sides real quick when I
told her it would relieve your fever.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:44.970
